{"id":"15c083801acd41a1","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-qml-formula.md","title":"Quantified Modal Language","display":"df-qml-formula — Quantified Modal Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-qml-formula","aliases":["89-df-qml-formula"],"display":"df-qml-formula — Quantified Modal Language","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-qml-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-qml-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qml-formula — Quantified Modal Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 为本条固定变量集；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 有可数多个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元谓词字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^{(k)}\">\\(P_i^{(k)}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>纯谓词模态语言没有项函数、常元和等号；原子仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^{(k)}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(P_i^{(k)}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_j\">\\(x_j\\)</span> 是变量。</li>\n<li>所有构造子为互异标记。自由变元集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_Q\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_Q\\)</span> 在原子处取参数变量集，在布尔处取并，在盒处不变，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\">\\(\\exists x\\)</span> 处删去 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\}\\cup\n\\{P_i^{(k)}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\mid i,k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x_j\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\\\\nQ_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Q_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,\\Box A,\\exists xA\\mid A\\in Q_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in Q_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Q_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\}\\cup\n\\{P_i^{(k)}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\mid i,k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x_j\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\\\\nQ_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Q_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,\\Box A,\\exists xA\\mid A\\in Q_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in Q_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Q_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 219–220；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n采用与原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\to,\\exists,\\Box\">\\(\\bot,\\to,\\exists,\\Box\\)</span> 等价的联结词基础。盒不是变量绑定子：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\\)</span>，不能把开放盒子公式误当作句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"P_i^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"P_i^{(k)}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)","display":false},{"tex":"x_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ_0&\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\}\\cup\n\\{P_i^{(k)}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\mid i,k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x_j\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\\\\nQ_{n+1}&\\coloneqq Q_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,\\Box A,\\exists xA\\mid A\\in Q_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in Q_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_Q&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Q_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot,\\to,\\exists,\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1594,"backlinks":[{"id":"7691d5ec76419b08","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ee07d81809d76030","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]] → [[89-df-open-provability-formula]] → [[89-df-qml-realization]] → [[89-df-qml-validity-sets]] → [[89-df-relative-completeness]] → [[89-thm-qml-complexity]] → [[89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable]]"}],"outgoing":["a257e5b1de6880b7"]}